---
const problems = [
  'You are cash-flow positive on paper, yet your net worth barely moves year to year.',
  'Your income, savings, investments and debts live in different places so no one view tells you the truth.',
  'You save whatever is left instead of the number your plan actually requires.',
  'Rising costs and shifting rates keep changing the maths, and you are still guessing.',
  'You have goals, but nothing connects this month\'s cash flow to them.',
  'Your money sits in an account structure you never intentionally designed.',
]
---
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 mb-5">
      <span class="h-px w-6 bg-[#FFBD40]"></span>
      Why you need this
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl text-black">The problem is not your income. It is structure.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-black/60">
      In an economy defined by rising costs, shifting interest rates and shrinking salary value, managing your finances on guesswork is no longer an option. High-earning professionals across Nigeria are cash-flow positive on paper and still not building wealth.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {problems.map((p) => (
      <li class="rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-[#F8F7F5] p-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black">
        <span class="mb-3 block h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD40]" aria-hidden></span>
        {p}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
    <a href="#pricing" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD40] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-black hover:brightness-95 transition">
      Fix the structure → NGN 6,999
    </a>
    <p class="flex items-center text-xs text-black/40">One-time payment · NGN 6,999</p>
  </div>
</section>
